        "verse": 6
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ECC",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "For there is a time and procedure for every purpose, although the misery of man is heavy on him.",
      "ko": "무론 무슨 일에든지 시기와 판단이 있으므로 사람에게 임하는 화가 심함이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "7fb33a2900e60317de91ded8cc5ca0a55a5b43310bfd93b48dbae64f6ea083c3",
      "translation_text_hash": "1b31a07c45de0b16021c42933cefadd627d0496317964dc5eae3195dcf869227",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
