        "verse": 7
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ECC",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "For he doesn’t know that which will be; for who can tell him how it will be?",
      "ko": "사람이 장래 일을 알지 못하나니 장래 일을 가르칠 자가 누구이랴",
      "source_text_hash": "fc6f0c557945d48122b0a1ec5eebc11749495c0ce965d9ed972429777ae974f9",
      "translation_text_hash": "83361f75032211801f758b2798e65ad2b2b24e74796af01fc4a21ee4b857919c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
